'''Mega Manectric ex''' (Japanese: '''メガライボルトex''' ''Mega Livolt ex'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Stage 1 {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion.

